---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Multistep Order Form";
const description =
  "An MVP purchase flow that turns a detailed order into a manageable sequence of decisions.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="max-w-2xl">
    <p class="mb-4 text-sm tracking-wide text-text-light">
      <a href="/projects" class="hover:text-primary">← Projects</a>
    </p>
    <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-text-light uppercase">Product Development</p>
    <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-black text-text-dark md:text-5xl">{title}</h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-text-light">{description}</p>

    <img
      src="/images/projects/multistep-order-form/cover.webp"
      alt="Multistep order form interface showing delivery details and progress"
      width="1200"
      height="900"
      class="mb-10 w-full rounded-lg bg-light object-contain p-4"
      loading="eager"
    />

    <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl text-text-dark">Overview</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 text-text-light">
      Long order forms make it difficult to understand what information is needed and how much work remains.
      This product concept breaks the process into focused steps with a clear sense of progress.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-10 text-text-light">
      The MVP prioritizes the core purchase journey and creates a foundation that can be tested before investing in
      broader account and administration features.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl text-text-dark">Approach</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 text-text-light">
      Related questions are grouped into short, scannable stages. Each step makes validation and next actions explicit,
      reducing the chance of losing work or discovering errors only at the end.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-10 text-text-light">
      A final review gives customers one place to verify their selections before submitting the order.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl text-text-dark">Focus areas</h2>
    <ul class="mb-10 list-disc pl-5 text-text-light space-y-1">
      <li>Flow definition and MVP scope</li>
      <li>Progressive disclosure and validation</li>
      <li>Responsive interaction design</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>
